    notes: "Minnesota tax-forfeiture: unpaid taxes → judgment → redemption period → forfeiture to State of Minnesota; Hennepin manages and sells. Post–Tyler v. Hennepin reforms: excess proceeds claims process for properties forfeited after Jan 1, 2024. Sales methods: traditional real estate listing, online auction, and over-the-counter. Inventory site: public-hennepin.epropertyplus.com. Contact tflinfo@hennepin.us / 612-348-3734.",
