    auctionFrequency: "Rolling as parcels complete forfeiture and classification; EMV sale ~4.5 months post-forfeiture (30-day window), then minimum-bid sale if unsold",
    depositRules: "Depends on sale method. Online auction and traditional listing terms are posted per property on ePropertyPlus. Repurchase (former owners only) requires full amount by cashier’s/certified check or money order plus non-refundable application fee. Confirm payment method on the specific listing.",
