    auctionPlatform: { label: "NM TRD Property Tax Division / Doña Ana County Treasurer — Delinquent Tax Auctions", url: "https://www.tax.newmexico.gov/businesses/property-tax-overview/delinquent-property-tax-auctions/" },
    auctionFrequency: "Periodic state-scheduled auctions when inventory is certified (multi-day possible; not monthly)",
    depositRules: "Register/attend per NM TRD auction notice for the specific sale date. Payment typically certified funds for high bid the day of sale — confirm exact deposit/balance rules on the sale notice. Verify parcel not pulled day-before. County Treasurer FAQ: once transferred to Division, all years must be paid in full to stop sale. Contact TRD PTD (505) 827-0883 and Doña Ana Treasurer 575-647-7200.",
