    auctionPlatform: { label: "TACS / Dudley Resources auctions for Prince William County tax sales", url: "https://taxva.com/rs-tax-sales/prince-william-county-real-estate-tax-sales/" },
    auctionFrequency: "Periodic as decrees of sale issue (multiple times per year; online non-judicial and judicial special commissioner sales posted on taxva.com)",
    depositRules: "Terms vary by sale notice: typically register with auctioneer for online bidding; day-of deposit percentage of bid in certified funds for in-person; court confirmation required before deed on judicial sales. Bidders may not owe delinquent taxes to Prince William County. Review each sale’s general terms package.",
