    survivingLiens: "A California tax deed conveys free of most prior encumbrances except those under R&T Code §3712, lis pendens, and undischarged federal IRS liens. County FAQs warn that foreclosed/unforeclosed street debt, irrigation assessments, and similar obligations may or may not be discharged — independent title research required.",
