    propertyAppraiser: { label: "San Luis Obispo County Assessor", url: "https://www.slocounty.ca.gov/", phone: "805-781-5643" },
    survivingLiens: "A California tax deed conveys free of most liens existing before the sale (R&T Code §3712), but federal tax liens survive (IRS 120-day post-sale redemption), as do taxes/assessments that become payable after the sale. Special assessments, 1915 Act bonds, and Mello-Roos may remain if not satisfied from sale proceeds — verify parcel-by-parcel.",
