    depositRules: "Register on RealAuction; deposit $200 or 5% of winning bid (whichever greater) — advance deposits supported on platform. Remainder due per Clerk FAQ timelines (typically within 24 hours in certified funds). Failure to fund can forfeit deposit and bar future sales (F.S. 197.542). Certificate applications via LienHub for Escambia.",
