    auctionFormat: "In-person (sealed bids with prior Commissioner approval if cannot attend)",
    auctionPlatform: { label: "Bonneville County Treasurer — Tax Deed and Estate Sales", url: "https://www.bonnevillecountyidaho.gov/page/tax-deed-and-estate-sales", phone: "208-529-1360" },
    auctionFrequency: "As properties become available — notices posted on Treasurer Tax Deed page (May 13, 2026 sale cancelled)",
    depositRules: "No registration fee to attend. Payment in full day of sale: cash, cashier's check, money order, personal or bank check (deeds for verified funds no sooner than day after sale; non-verified funds subject to bank clearance). Sold AS IS, WHERE IS — county makes no guarantees on liens, condition, or title insurance feasibility. Physical inspection by appointment with Treasurer (208-529-1380).",
