    survivingLiens: "County tax deed sales typically cut off most private liens that attached before the tax deed, subject to federal liens and sale-specific exceptions. County expressly disclaims lien/encumbrance warranties — independent title search required.",
    quietTitle: "Title companies often require quiet title or extended seasoning before insuring Idaho tax-deed property.",
