    survivingLiens: "Forfeiture to the state/county then public sale generally cuts off most private liens; federal liens and some assessments can survive. Repurchase rights may exist for former owners in limited cases under MN statutes.",
    quietTitle: "Often used when insurers want additional comfort beyond the forfeiture judgment, especially for improved residential property in Mankato.",
