    survivingLiens: "Tax lien assignment is not ownership. Federal liens and special improvement district issues need review. Possession remains with owner until tax deed issues after full notice process.",
    quietTitle: "After treasurer's tax deed, quiet title is commonly required for marketable title insurance before resale.",
