    auctionFrequency: "As needed when parcels are referred for tax foreclosure — no single annual mass sale; check Collections and Sheriff dockets continuously",
    depositRules: "Set by judgment, notice of sale, and conducting officer (often 5–10% deposit with certified funds balance on confirmation schedule — verify each notice). Properties may be sold subject to superior liens if not extinguished by the decree. Register and bring ID per notice. Review upset-bid period under NC foreclosure practice if applicable to the sale type.",
