    depositRules: "Highest bidder posts 20% deposit in cash or certified funds payable to Gaston County Sheriff’s Office at sale (resold on spot if deposit short). After 10-day upset period closes without higher bid, high bidder has 10 days to bring remaining funds (cash/certified to Sheriff) at Tax Office or forfeit deposit. Upset bid: must exceed current bid by 5% or $750 (whichever greater); deposit $750 if bid ≤$15,000 else 5% of new bid; cash/certified to Clerk of Superior Court in person. Owner may redeem during upset period by paying taxes in full.",
