    survivingLiens: "Non-warranted sheriff’s deed. May remain subject to IRS liens, city/county taxes for years not in the judgment, easements, and other restrictions of record. Deed description can include land already sold off — full title/GIS research mandatory.",
    quietTitle: "Often required for marketable/insurable title after NC tax foreclosure; insurers commonly want quiet title or extended curative work before conventional finance/resale.",
