    auctionFrequency: "Periodically as cases complete foreclosure (no fixed calendar)",
    depositRules: "Sale-day deposit per commissioner/notice (NC tax foreclosures commonly require substantial certified deposit — confirm notice). Upset bid: certified bank check to Pender County, 5% over prior bid with $750 minimum increase, filed with Register of Deeds within 10 days of report of sale. Contact Deputy Finance Officer for upset logistics (Angela Miller / amiller@pendercountync.gov per county page).",
