    depositRules: "Per sale notice: high bidder posts required deposit at auction (cash/certified); balance after 10-day upset period and confirmation. Upset bids in person at Clerk of Superior Court under NC statutory raise (typically 5% or $750 min) with deposit. Confirm current clerk/attorney instructions on the notice for each sale date.",
