    depositRules: "Register at fairfield.sheriffsaleauction.ohio.gov; complete RealAuction webinar training recommended. Deposit via ACH/wire per platform tiers and deadlines (wire typically 2 business days before sale). Properties sold AS IS. Purchaser responsible for costs, allowances, and taxes sale proceeds do not cover (ORC 2329.21). Tax-foreclosure buyers must return the no-delinquent-tax affidavit after sale or title will not transfer.",
    taxCollector: { label: "Fairfield County Sheriff — Sheriff’s Sales (Civil)", url: "https://sheriff.fairfield.oh.us/FC-Sheriff-Auction-Sales.html", phone: "740-652-7900" },
