    notes: "Ohio hybrid / sheriff tax-foreclosure county (ORC ch. 5721 / 2329). Greene County Sheriff runs retail-accessible foreclosure sales — including delinquent tax and commercial tracks — online via RealAuction (greene.sheriffsaleauction.ohio.gov). Delinquent Tax and Commercial Sales use a 10% of purchase-price deposit schedule; balance due after confirmation. Mortgage and tax cases share the platform but tax-track rules differ — read each sale notice. Separate Treasurer delinquent-tax search for inventory research. Dayton MSA east (Xenia, Beavercreek, Fairborn / Wright-Patterson AFB influence).",
