    propertyAppraiser: { label: "Knox County Auditor", url: "https://co.knox.oh.us/auditor/" },
    survivingLiens: "Proper judicial/sheriff sale with named parties generally cuts off junior liens; federal tax liens and omitted parties create residual risk. Purchaser may be responsible for costs taxes do not cover. Full title search mandatory.",
    quietTitle: "Sheriff deed after confirmation often supports marketable title; quiet title still common if notice defects or occupied property.",
