    survivingLiens: "Bulk certificate sale transfers collection rights, not deeds. Owner redemption and later foreclosure under ORC 5721. Federal liens can survive. Land bank / exemption filters remove many parcels from eligibility.",
    quietTitle: "After any later tax foreclosure deed, quiet title often used for insurance. Retail investors generally cannot buy individual Lake certificates.",
