    auctionPlatform: { label: "Bid4Assets — Fayette County Tax Claim Upset / Judicial sales", url: "https://www.bid4assets.com" },
    auctionFrequency: "Upset annually mid/late September (2026: Sept 21–22); Judicial typically mid-year; Repository ongoing",
    depositRules: "Complete all Bid4Assets vesting/funding steps and Tax Claim appointment before close of registration. Fund deposit per Bid4Assets storefront for the sale. Appointments first-come; missed appointments not rescheduled if slots full. Absolute last registration day announced on county Upset Sale page — follow Bid4Assets + county instructions exactly.",
