    notes: "Pennsylvania RETSL tax-deed via Lancaster County Tax Claim Bureau. Upset Tax Sale annually mid-September online via GovDeals (2026 Upset commencing Monday September 14, 2026). Continued Upset and Judicial Sales historically mid-November online on GovDeals. Pre-registration required with hard deadlines. Upset leaves many liens attached; Judicial aims free-and-clear after lienholder notice. Note: Lancaster is among PA counties with post-sale owner redemption rights in some contexts — verify current RETSL/local practice before bidding.",
