    auctionFrequency: "Upset annually late September (2026: Sept 24); Judicial annually April (2026: April 23)",
    depositRules: "Pre-register online during published window (Upset 2026: Sept 7–11). Funding and deposit rules per online auction vendor packet for that sale. Delinquent tax payments to Bureau: cash, cashier's check/money order, or card (+2.45%) — no personal/business checks. Contact taxclaim@lawrencecountypa.gov or (724) 656-2125.",
