    notes: "Pennsylvania RETSL tax-deed via Lehigh County Tax Claim Bureau (Elite Revenue Solutions agent). Upset Sale first annual offer for ~2-year delinquencies — 2026 Upset Wednesday September 9, 2026 10:00 a.m.; Judicial Sale Wednesday October 7, 2026 10:00 a.m. — both at Cedar Crest College, Alumnae Hall, 100 College Drive, Allentown. Upset sold subject to liens/encumbrances; Judicial freer title after process. Bidder affidavit and bid sheet required; Act 33 registration rules apply. Allentown–Bethlehem–Easton (Lehigh Valley) market.",
