    auctionPlatform: { label: "Aiken County Delinquent Tax Collector — Annual Delinquent Tax Sale", url: "https://www.aikencountysc.gov/309/Delinquent-Tax-Sale" },
    auctionFrequency: "Annually in November (confirm exact date when 2026 packet posts ~Sept 1); not the monthly Master-in-Equity docket",
    depositRules: "Full payment typically required day of sale in certified funds per SC tax-sale practice (confirm 2026 bidder packet). Pre-registration often required; no sale-day tax payoffs after published deadline. Redemption within 12 months: certified funds/cash/cashier’s check/money order (or attorney/mortgage checks) payable to Aiken County Tax Collector with proper ID. Defaulting bidder penalties under SC Code §12-51-70. Do not request bid amounts or overage info during redemption except as statute allows.",
