    depositRules: "Full payment same day in cash or cashier’s check only. Failure to pay subject to legal action. Pre-registration form available on county site. Research parcels via assessment.cot.tn.gov. Sold AS IS/WHERE IS. Sale incomplete until Order Confirming Sale signed.",
