    depositRules: "Register on GovEase (opens ~2 weeks before sale). Highest bidder pays bid plus transfer tax (sale price/100 × 0.0037) in full within 48 hours by cashier’s check, money order, or cash only — no personal checks or cards. Failure to pay may bring court action and future bidding ban. Order Confirming Sale ~30 days after auction, then recorded at Register’s Office.",
