    depositRules: "Must obtain a Statement of No Delinquent Tax from the Brazoria County Tax Office under Tax Code §34.015 ($10 fee; notarized request; mail ≥10 days before sale — not processed sale day). Payment same day: cash, money order, or cashier’s check payable to Brazoria County Sheriff’s Office, exact funds only; personal/company checks only with bank letter of guaranty. Must return with funds by 12:00 p.m. sale day or property may be reoffered; failure can draw a court motion for fine.",
