    depositRules: "Pre-register day of sale with valid government ID; entity bidders need authority docs. Pay cash or cashier’s check payable to GUADALUPE COUNTY DISTRICT CLERK. Default can trigger 20% liability + costs (TRCP 652). Minimum bid on bid sheet covers judgment taxes; purchaser must also pay taxes accruing after judgment. No warranty deed; title insurance often difficult. Possession rights begin 20 days after deed recording (Tax Code §33.51).",
