    survivingLiens: "HOA/POA liens can survive a Texas tax sale if the association recorded its lien and was not properly joined/notified in the foreclosure suit. Federal tax liens survive. City demolition/mowing and POA fees may remain. Always search deed records and city code liens before bidding.",
