    auctionFrequency: "As decrees of sale are entered — periodic, not a fixed monthly retail calendar; watch taxva.com and auctioneer pages",
    depositRules: "Set per sale notice/decree and auctioneer terms (Dudley/TACS). Typical VA judicial practice: deposit percentage on sale day with balance in a short window; certified funds common. Court may reject bids that shock the conscience / fail fair-value findings. Properties sold AS IS subject to terms posted by Special Commissioner. Confirm current online vendor before each round.",
